  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Additional circuitry that links your body with weapons and devices.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Neuroport/Personal Link Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> While utilizing the enhanced Personal Link for operating a cyberlinked vehicle or similar machine, the user gains a +1 bonus to the Skill required to do so (Drive Land Vehicle, Drive Sea Vehicle, Pilot Air Vehicle, etc). This bonus also applies to weapons controlled purely via a Personal Link, such as ones installed in a Vehicle Heavy Weapon Mount or ACPA. This does not stack with bonuses from a Smartgun Link or Smart Rebuild.</p>\n<p>When using the Personal Link to connect to a Cyberdeck being used for a Netrun, all of the user’s rezzed Non-Black ICE programs gain a +1 bonus to their ATK or DEF (User chooses which when they Jack In).</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Neural Link or Interface Plugs<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corgo calls these a Neuroport and a Personal Link; the core system ships them as the Neural Link and Interface Plugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
